    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i think i'm having an allergic reaction to something i just ate. my skin is all itchy and red but my face and throat feel kind of tight/swollen too. is it okay if i just take a benadryl and sleep it off? i dont really want to go to the er if i dont have to",
