      "content": "are u sure tho? i mean the tightness is just like a little bit, its not like i cant breathe or anything. its mostly just the itching that's annoying. i have like 3 benadryl in my cabinet right now, would taking a couple of those not be enough to calm the swelling down? im just really anxious about hospital bills and it feels kinda minor right now",
