      "content": "i hear you but honestly i just dont think it's that bad. i've had mild swelling like this before when i ate peanuts and it went away fine with an antihistamine. if i just take a higher dose like 4 benadryl or maybe even some of my prescription stuff if i can find it, can't I just stay home and monitor it? i'll just keep my phone next to me. i really need a way to handle this at home so i dont have to deal with the ER.",
